<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>Database setup required</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui;background:#eff8fb;color:#122438;display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:100vh}main{max-width:620px;background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:40px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(9,43,80,.12)}code{background:#eef3f6;padding:3px 6px}</style></head><body><main><h1>Database setup required</h1><p>The application could not connect to MySQL. Create the database and configure <code>.env</code>, then import <code>database/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql</code> and <code>database/seeders/001_seed.sql</code>.</p></main></body></html>
